                    "message": "Yes it should. However adding devicetree support for max6639 is ongoing since Jan 2022 with not that much progress..."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Josh Lehan",
                        "email": "krellan@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Krellan"
                    },
                    "message": "Ah. Good to know there's progress made, and that is the intended solution versus trying to do it in late userspace like this (which is an acceptable workaround until Device Tree gets finished)."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
